# =====================================================================
# .gitignore - The Indian Money Book repo
# =====================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Agnes agent working area (research, caches, generated artifacts)
#    The book's clean sources of truth (book.md, book.pdf) are committed
#    from the repo root; everything under .agnes/ is build/scratch output.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.agnes/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Build tooling used only to produce book.pdf (not part of the book)
#    The build workspace lives under .agnes/ (already ignored). If someone
#    ever installs deps into a top-level node_modules, ignore it too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
package-lock.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Intermediate / build outputs
#    Keep the finished book.pdf, ignore regenerable intermediate HTML,
#    logs, previews, and any stray build scripts left at the root.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
preview-*.png
pp*.png
pdf-page*.png
book.html
install.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. OS junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.cab
*.msi
*.lnk
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
# Linux
*~
trash-*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Editor / IDE / tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
/.project
/.classpath
/.settings/
*.iml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Testing / cache
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Environment / secrets - never commit real credentials
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
